Exact ble_store.c, ble_store_config.c and ble_store_util.c bytes are retained from
NimBLE-Arduino 2.3.7 as guarded SDK evidence. security_store_corpus.c is
Litch test code with controlled NVS leaves; it is not the SDK or physical NVS.

Exact ble_gatts.c and ble_svc_gatt.c bytes are retained from NimBLE-Arduino
2.3.7 as guarded GATT evidence. csfc_gatt_corpus.c supplies controlled host,
mbuf and scheduling leaves; the existing store corpus supplies controlled NVS.

Exact ble_sm.c bytes are retained from NimBLE-Arduino 2.3.7 as guarded SMP
evidence. pairing_admission_corpus.c supplies controlled host/RF/crypto leaves;
the existing security-store corpus supplies controlled NVS. It does not
establish physical pairing, RF or flash behavior.
empty_peer_store_corpus.c reuses that controlled NVS owner for deliberate
durable-empty reconciliation; retained local-IRK/RPA records are excluded.

Exact ble_hs_pvcy.c bytes are retained from NimBLE-Arduino 2.3.7 as guarded
privacy evidence. HCI responses remain controlled; this is not physical RF proof.
